title: camelot-wheel
abstract: "Camelot wheel and harmonic mixing toolkit for DJs: convert keys (Camelot, Open Key, Am, La menor), list compatible keys and energy moves, check mashups and order a playlist into a harmonic set. Zero-dependency JS + CLI."
